        "TileImage": "$($repository 671746f4-eecd-417d-b0cd-1ad49e88f0c2).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings Agent 48, Our Client&apos;s Work of Life has been Mocked online by a Man Named &apos;Delgado&apos;...Naturally it HAS TO BE Infamous Delgado Family from Santa Fortuna, You have been Assigned to &apos;Help&apos; Miss Catalina Fight her Phobias, &apos;Cut&apos; This Yee-Yee ass Haircut of Mr. Hector, and by Any Method Possible Eliminate Mister Rico...To cover the Financial part of this Operation, Steal Their Luxury Car for our Friend Mr. Yeteran all while Dressed as Mr. Rico&apos;s Favourite Mariachi Band Member, Good luck 48",
